Verse 1:
[Bb]Don't forget the Sabbath, The [F]Lord our God hath [Eb]ble[Bb]st,
[Bb]Of all the week the brightest, Of [F]all the [C]week the [F]best;
[F]It brings repose from [Bb]labor, It [F]tells of joy di[Bb]vine,
[Bb]Its beams of [F7]light de[Gm]scend[Eb]ing, With [Bb]heav'nly [F]beauty [Bb]shine.
[Bb]Welcome, [Eb7]welcome, [Gm]ever [Eb]welcome, [Bb]Blessèd[F] Sabbath[Eb] da[Bb]y.
[Bb]Welcome, [Eb7]welcome, [Gm]ever [Eb]welcome, [Bb]Blessèd[F7] Sabbath[Bb] day.

