[F]Who [Bb]said [F]to [Bb]His disciples,
[Bb][F7]"I [Gm]am [Eb][Bb]the [F]living [Bb]way;"
[Bb][Eb7]And [Gm][Eb]if [Bb]we [F][Eb]meekly [Bb]follow
[Bb][Eb7]Our [Gm][Eb]Savior [Bb][F7]here [Bb]below,
[Bb]He'll [F]give us [Eb]of [Bb]the fountain
